    "title": "Add private note to support ticket",
    "category": "Conversations",
    "description": "Add a private note to a support ticket. The note is visible to your team only and is never sent to the customer; this tool has no privacy option. Use it to leave findings where the support engineer works. To reply to the customer, use conversations-tickets-reply-create instead. To change a note later, use conversations-tickets-notes-partial-update. An identical note posted again within a short window returns the original note instead of adding a second one. Returns the note as it appears in the thread.",
